# Paths that exist ONLY on the `dev` branch: guides, demos, tests and tooling.
# `npm run sync:main` (scripts/sync-main.sh) publishes dev → main and deletes these paths from main.
#
# One path or bash glob per line, relative to the repo root. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Never list product files here: extension/, README.md, LICENSE, CHANGELOG.md, docs/PRIVACY.md (the Chrome Web
# Store privacy-policy URL points at main), the images README.md shows, .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE, .gitignore.

# Notes for Claude / contributors
CLAUDE.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
.mainignore

# Guides
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
docs/PUBLISHING.md
docs/STORE_LISTING.md
store-assets/screenshots/README.md

# Demo / dev harness
dev

# Tests
tests

# Tooling (build, check, package, sync, CI)
scripts
i18n
package.json
.github/workflows

# Store-upload working files (README only uses the promo marquee + screenshots/*.png)
store-assets/src
store-assets/render.sh
store-assets/screenshots/en
store-assets/screenshots/vi
store-assets/logo-512.png
store-assets/promo-small-440x280.png
store-assets/store-icon-128.png
